	"data": "Concept: Thought Bubbles (Reassessed Sep 2026)\n\nWhat It Is\nA spatial, node-based knowledge app — the most persistent project in cithoreal's entire corpus (214+ journal mentions). Predates the vault and in many ways anticipated it.\n\nSometimes called \"Dot Bubbles\", \"Top Bubbles\" in working notes — same project at different stages.\n\nArchitecture (from journals)\nNode = a \"thought bubble\" — any data (primitive leaf → compound thought)\nThought space = linked cluster of bubbles\nLinking = typed…",
